    "detailed_description": "<h1>Please follow us</h1><p><br>Discord: <br>Youtube: Drive Me Crazy\u6211\u4e3a\u60c5\u72c2<br>X(Twitter): @wwqkdmecrazy<br>Tiktok: DriveMeCrazy</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About us</h2>Love is a strong, positive emotional state with powerful force, much like the passion each of us brought when creating this product. We crafted Qiangzi, and we are Qiangzi; we hope every Qiangzi can feel our sincerity and experience a variety of emotions. Life is finite, but joy is infinite\u2014please enjoy going crazy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction of Drive Me Crazy</h2>Mikami,the most popular contemporary idol, opens a cake shop after retiring from the military for the sake of her beloved Qiangzi and she decides to marry her lover Qiangzi. However, Mikami was very upset when Qiangzi lost his wedding ring at his own bachelor party. What Mikami didn't realize was that Qiangzi was also has ties with the tycoon's first love, the national female idol, the sexy pet doctor, the well-known football commentator, the sickly traditional-style girl, the wealthy female boss, and the rock-and-roll biker girl. Mikami's only request is that Qiangzi find the wedding ring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/d401fa4109284ab9f625868d10156f71.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 /></span><br><br>Kana Mikami: Good morning, Qiangzi! Tomorrow is the day we're taking our wedding photos. Why are you still in bed?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/7aae2021c9ef7e4773763976c93e93d2.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/7aae2021c9ef7e4773763976c93e93d2.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/7aae2021c9ef7e4773763976c93e93d2.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Chen Youqing: Am I pretty\uff1f<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/ea1dc370349518cae17c0428b965528b.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/ea1dc370349518cae17c0428b965528b.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/ea1dc370349518cae17c0428b965528b.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cao Jingrui: Did you get kicked in the head with a ball?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/868b7abe6912324242e480c10dda91a2.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/868b7abe6912324242e480c10dda91a2.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/868b7abe6912324242e480c10dda91a2.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Shen Niannian\uff1aI just want to marry you\uff0ceven if it\u2018s fake.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a0f5c7522274e85324de0037a1e19e1e.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a0f5c7522274e85324de0037a1e19e1e.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a0f5c7522274e85324de0037a1e19e1e.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Xia Meng\uff1aThe wild grass and roses in your heart only be me.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/3043eb147e0fc549c39eaa230df38533.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/3043eb147e0fc549c39eaa230df38533.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/3043eb147e0fc549c39eaa230df38533.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Jiang Jialin\uff1aDid I allow you to speak\uff1f<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a64dbecee473092acf02fce21532c39b.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a64dbecee473092acf02fce21532c39b.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/a64dbecee473092acf02fce21532c39b.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>An Siyu\uff1aYou like our pure relationship too, right\uff1f<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/c957059a4b7fadc721e65601bdfc4ff4.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/c957059a4b7fadc721e65601bdfc4ff4.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/c957059a4b7fadc721e65601bdfc4ff4.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cindy\uff1aWhat I want is for you belong to me, nothing else matters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/4df78c77d0995462cbaeac162786c16f.poster.avif?t=1755071731\" width=614 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/4df78c77d0995462cbaeac162786c16f.webm?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918550/extras/4df78c77d0995462cbaeac162786c16f.mp4?t=1755071731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Features</h2><br><strong>Intense Immersion</strong><br>To provide players with a more immersive experience, not only is the game shot from a first-person perspective, but every scene is also carefully crafted to closely align with the game characters. Each character and scene is designed to harmonize well, enhancing the player's sense of integration.<br><br><strong>Game Worldview </strong><br>The entire story is well-rounded, differentiating itself from homogeneous live-action interactive film games by using a non-linear narrative approach. There are ten characters, with eight main characters distinctly developed. Each has a unique emotional entanglement with the protagonist, ensuring logical plot progression. The storyline contains many surprising Easter eggs, catering to players with varied interests.<br><br><strong>Ten Beauties </strong><br>Ten emotional experiences, with character designs that closely align with the camera work, aesthetically and logically coordinated. Each character does not merely have a forced affection for Qiangzi; instead, each develops a unique emotional connection with the player, crafted to deliver a distinct emotional experience. Everyone is Qiangzi, each designed to drive me crazy.<br><br><strong>Game Highlights</strong><br>Beyond the story, plot, and visuals, the most significant highlight of the game is the addition of eight mini-games. The outcomes of these games influence the direction of the main storyline, offering a level of player engagement unprecedented in similar games.<br><br><strong>Exclusive Soundtrack </strong><br>The game's theme song, &quot;Animals,&quot; is composed by the independent band Mixin. Each character has their own unique piece of music, enhancing the atmosphere and the sense of immersion.",
